<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:06.800" end="00:00:11.300" style="s2">You little brat.</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.800" end="00:00:14.000" style="s2">You stole my rare bird.</p>
<p begin="00:00:11.300" end="00:00:14.000" style="s2">Give it back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.500" end="00:00:19.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re so capable,</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.200" end="00:00:19.300" style="s2">go catch it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.800" end="00:00:32.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; COME ON,</p>
<p begin="00:00:28.600" end="00:00:32.000" style="s2">ANNA. SWEEPING TENSION.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.100" end="00:00:39.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP OR I&#39;LL KILL HER.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.885" end="00:00:45.905" style="s2">[groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.470" end="00:00:51.900" style="s2">[music] JUST YOU WAIT.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.600" end="00:01:06.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M SORRY YOU GOT HURT BECAUSE OF ME.</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.800" end="00:01:07.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m all right.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.400" end="00:01:08.800" style="s2">But you&#39;ve made enemies of the thugs</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.800" end="00:01:10.600" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.800" end="00:01:12.800" style="s2">We may need to live somewhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.600" end="00:01:14.000" style="s2">They&#39;ll keep coming back to trouble us.</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.800" end="00:01:17.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.000" end="00:01:17.000" style="s2">We&#39;ll go somewhere else together.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.255" end="00:01:21.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.495" end="00:01:26.515" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.080" end="00:01:31.100" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.800" end="00:01:38.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come, Anna.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.100" end="00:01:38.100" style="s2">We must find a place.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.906" end="00:01:40.926" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.491" end="00:01:45.511" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.200" end="00:02:02.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on. Don&#39;t let go.</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.486" end="00:02:04.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:10.346" end="00:02:12.366" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.131" end="00:02:43.151" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.502" end="00:03:21.087" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.492" end="00:03:23.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold on. Don&#39;t let go.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.087" end="00:03:23.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.492" end="00:03:27.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.592" end="00:03:29.992" style="s2">I didn&#39;t mean to wake you.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.292" end="00:03:31.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is this strange human doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.992" end="00:03:34.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was in a shipwreck.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.692" end="00:03:36.592" style="s2">When I woke up, I was here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.692" end="00:03:37.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can understand me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.592" end="00:03:42.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.692" end="00:03:42.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way. A human who understands birds.</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.597" end="00:03:50.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.182" end="00:03:55.202" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.557" end="00:04:11.577" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.142" end="00:04:16.162" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:04:22.657" end="00:04:25.332" style="s2">[gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.312" end="00:04:25.332" style="s2">[sighs and panting]</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.028" end="00:05:00.048" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.923" end="00:05:05.943" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.263" end="00:05:24.283" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.594" end="00:05:30.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Poor little bird.</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.694" end="00:05:32.694" style="s2">I don&#39;t know why you hatched all alone</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.494" end="00:05:36.094" style="s2">out there in the snow.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.694" end="00:05:36.094" style="s2">I&#39;ll take care of you from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.894" end="00:05:45.694" style="s2">Wake up, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:03.295" style="s2">Oh,</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.694" end="00:06:05.595" style="s2">a phoenix.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.295" end="00:06:05.595" style="s2">Where?</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.424" end="00:06:11.444" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.295" end="00:06:17.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one.</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.395" end="00:06:18.495" style="s2">The bird traveling with you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.195" end="00:06:21.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No way.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.495" end="00:06:21.795" style="s2">It&#39;s just an ordinary swallow.</p>
<p begin="00:06:22.895" end="00:06:27.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps I was mistaken.</p>
<p begin="00:06:24.895" end="00:06:27.995" style="s2">It only looks like one.</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.279" end="00:06:38.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.794" end="00:06:46.814" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.034" end="00:06:52.054" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.195" end="00:07:17.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The gem would not glow unless it came</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.795" end="00:07:19.495" style="s2">into contact with a fire phoenix.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.495" end="00:07:20.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The only fire phoenix left was my elder</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.495" end="00:07:22.295" style="s2">sister.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.795" end="00:07:23.395" style="s2">We had the same father but different</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.295" end="00:07:24.895" style="s2">mothers.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.395" end="00:07:27.695" style="s2">She is dead.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.895" end="00:07:27.695" style="s2">This is impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.895" end="00:07:37.595" style="s2">Could the sacred gem be mistaken?</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.495" end="00:07:37.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It has never been wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.055" end="00:07:47.075" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.950" end="00:07:52.970" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.535" end="00:07:57.555" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.795" end="00:08:05.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll sleep here from now on.</p>
<p begin="00:08:16.495" end="00:08:18.515" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:26.297" end="00:08:30.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, I&#39;m so hot.</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.497" end="00:08:32.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.797" end="00:08:35.397" style="s2">Are you sick?</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.897" end="00:08:38.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m burning up. It feels like I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:08:35.397" end="00:08:38.497" style="s2">sitting in a fire.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.697" end="00:08:45.370" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, I&#39;m so hot.</p>
<p begin="00:08:43.350" end="00:08:45.370" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.246" end="00:08:51.266" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:08:56.451" end="00:08:58.471" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.691" end="00:09:03.711" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.897" end="00:09:12.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impossible.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.097" end="00:09:14.497" style="s2">Only a fire phoenix can take human form</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.297" end="00:09:17.466" style="s2">while still young.</p>
<p begin="00:09:14.497" end="00:09:17.466" style="s2">Could you be a fire phoenix? [music]</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.497" end="00:09:23.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama,</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.897" end="00:09:23.297" style="s2">now I look just [music] like you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.297" end="00:09:30.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mustn&#39;t tell anyone about this.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.697" end="00:09:32.897" style="s2">I don&#39;t know who you really are yet. Let</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.997" end="00:09:34.397" style="s2">me find out first.</p>
<p begin="00:09:32.897" end="00:09:37.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, mama.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.397" end="00:09:37.197" style="s2">I&#39;ll listen to you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.986" end="00:10:02.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.997" end="00:10:07.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From now on, we&#39;ll live here, my dear.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.498" end="00:10:20.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I smell a fire Phoenix.</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.098" end="00:10:20.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. You must be mistaken.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.098" end="00:10:31.198" style="s2">A young fire Phoenix has been found.</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.398" end="00:10:33.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we must capture her without delay.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.198" end="00:10:36.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go. Bring her to me immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.698" end="00:10:36.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As you command.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.498" end="00:10:42.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; RUN!</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.527" end="00:10:46.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:10:56.317" end="00:10:58.337" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.902" end="00:11:02.922" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.797" end="00:11:08.817" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.072" end="00:11:14.002" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.037" end="00:11:16.022" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:11:14.002" end="00:11:16.022" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.862" end="00:11:23.882" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.398" end="00:11:31.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHO ARE YOU?</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.798" end="00:11:34.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOUR HIGHNESS.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.298" end="00:11:36.498" style="s2">I CAME TOO LATE. PLEASE forgive me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:34.198" end="00:11:39.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What Princess?</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.498" end="00:11:39.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you so.</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.698" end="00:11:45.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is going on?</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.398" end="00:11:47.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was sent to the Border Mountains when</p>
<p begin="00:11:45.098" end="00:11:49.998" style="s2">dragons began attacking our frontier. We</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.598" end="00:11:51.798" style="s2">fought for three days and three nights.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.998" end="00:11:54.698" style="s2">In the last battle, I defeated them and</p>
<p begin="00:11:51.798" end="00:11:54.698" style="s2">reclaimed the border.</p>
<p begin="00:11:57.233" end="00:11:59.253" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:02.473" end="00:12:04.493" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.098" end="00:12:11.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Queen Aveline laid an egg in secret.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.998" end="00:12:12.398" style="s2">With the war raging, she planned to</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.198" end="00:12:13.799" style="s2">announce her child only after the egg</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.398" end="00:12:14.999" style="s2">hatched. When I came back, the Queen was</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.799" end="00:12:15.899" style="s2">dead and no one mentioned of hiding the</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.999" end="00:12:18.299" style="s2">egg. I thought she must have been</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.899" end="00:12:20.099" style="s2">searching for her child all these years.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.299" end="00:12:21.499" style="s2">The blood of the Fire Phoenix runs</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.099" end="00:12:23.599" style="s2">through [music] you. You are the High</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.499" end="00:12:25.399" style="s2">Princess of the Phoenixes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:23.599" end="00:12:26.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Elara is the future Queen?</p>
<p begin="00:12:25.399" end="00:12:27.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.299" end="00:12:31.199" style="s2">We have to leave at once. Visenya will</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.699" end="00:12:31.199" style="s2">be here soon. Go now!</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.603" end="00:12:34.623" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.188" end="00:12:39.208" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:12:45.899" end="00:12:47.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.399" end="00:12:49.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A secret refuge. [music]</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.599" end="00:12:50.499" style="s2">Queen Aveline never fully trusted</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.099" end="00:12:51.999" style="s2">Visenya, so she had this place built</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.499" end="00:12:55.299" style="s2">while she was alive. We&#39;ll stay here</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.999" end="00:12:55.299" style="s2">until our young Queen is grown.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.388" end="00:13:05.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:16.489" end="00:13:18.509" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.384" end="00:13:24.404" style="s2">[music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
